KEY COST DRIVERS (What to Watch)
🔴 High Risk / High Variability:
1.	Engineering Salaries (40% of budget)
o	Risk: Talent shortage drives salaries up 20-30%
o	Mitigation: Hire remote, offer equity, hire earlier-career engineers
2.	CDN / Infrastructure (15% of budget)
o	Risk: Viral growth = 10x traffic spike = massive overage charges
o	Mitigation: Set spending alerts, negotiate volume discounts
3.	Legal / Compliance (2-3% of budget)
o	Risk: FERPA violation = $50K fine + legal costs
o	Mitigation: Get it right from day one, hire expert counsel
🟡 Medium Risk:
4.	Marketing / User Acquisition
o	Risk: CAC (Customer Acquisition Cost) is higher than expected
o	Mitigation: Focus on organic growth first, test paid channels slowly
🟢 Low Risk / Predictable:
5.	Tools & Subscriptions
o	Risk: Minimal—costs are known and fixed
o	Mitigation: N/A
 
